<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>学业互助 · 华师答疑资源共享平台</title>
<meta name="description" content="华南师范大学学业互助答疑资源共享平台：课程问题发帖互助、学习资料上传共享，AI 辅助题目解析与知识提炼。">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>

<!-- ================= 顶部导航 ================= -->
<header class="site-header">
  <div class="wrap header-inner">
    <a class="brand" href="#/home">
      <span class="brand-mark">学</span>
      <span class="brand-text">
        <strong>学业互助</strong>
        <em>华师答疑 · 资源共享</em>
      </span>
    </a>
    <nav class="nav" id="nav">
      <a href="#/home" data-route="home" class="is-active">首页</a>
      <a href="#/qa" data-route="qa">答疑区</a>
      <a href="#/resources" data-route="resources">资料库</a>
      <a href="#/ai" data-route="ai">AI 助手</a>
      <a href="#/mine" data-route="mine">我的</a>
      <a href="#/about" data-route="about">关于</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="header-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="navAsk">＋ 我要提问</button>
      <div class="auth-area" id="authArea">
    <button class="auth-chip" id="navUser" title="进入我的空间">
      <span class="auth-avatar">C</span>
      <span class="auth-name">C4ci</span>
    </button>
    <button class="btn btn-text btn-sm" id="navLogout">退出</button></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="cloud-notice" id="cloudNotice" hidden=""></div>

<main id="app">

<!-- ================= 首页 ================= -->
<section class="page" id="page-home">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <span class="pill">华南师范大学 · 校园轻量化学业交流平台</span>
        <h1>学习上的疑问，<br>不该只躺在群聊里</h1>
        <p class="lead">
          问题散落在几十个课程群，复习资料存在各自的网盘，遇到难题时问不出去、也搜不到。
          这里把答疑和资料按课程归拢到一起，再加上 AI 随时帮你拆题、提炼、做总结。
          注册一个账号，你发过的一切都会存档在这里，换台设备也找得回来。
        </p>
        <form class="hero-search" id="heroSearchForm">
          <input type="search" id="heroSearch" placeholder="搜课程、搜问题、搜资料…例如「二叉树遍历」「高数 极限」">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">搜索</button>
        </form>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button class="btn btn-primary" id="heroAsk">发起一个提问</button>
          <button class="btn btn-ghost" id="heroUpload">上传复习资料</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-side">
        <div class="hero-card">
          <h4>今天同学们在问</h4>
          <ul class="hero-feed" id="heroFeed">
    <li data-jump="6">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span class="t">计算机网络：TCP 三次握手为什么不是两次？</span>
      <span class="c">计算机网络</span>
    </li>
    <li data-jump="4">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span class="t">操作系统：PV 操作题目里信号量的初值到底怎么定？</span>
      <span class="c">操作系统</span>
    </li>
    <li data-jump="5">
      <span class="dot"></span>
      <span class="t">线性代数：为什么实对称矩阵一定可以正交对角化？</span>
      <span class="c">线性代数</span>
    </li></ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="stats" id="stats">
      <div class="stat"><b id="statQ">6</b><span>个问题已提出</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="statSolved">3</b><span>个问题被解决</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="statA">5</b><span>条同学回答</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><b id="statR">9</b><span>份资料在共享</span></div>
    </div>

    <h2 class="section-title">按课程找内容</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">所有问题和资料都挂在具体课程下，不用再翻群聊天记录。</p>
    <div class="course-grid" id="courseGrid">
      <button class="course-card" data-course="ds">
