    <h2 class="section-title">为什么用它</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">同学互助解决「有人能答」，AI 解决「随时能问」。</p>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <article class="card feature">
        <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
